  "description": "Why does he look like my ex...? \n\nAfter a traumatic first love, Mi-Jeong is determined to put her past behind her and start fresh in college. But when she enters school, she meets an upperclassman with the exact same face as her first love! Will she be able to heal her past scars and learn to love again? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
